        "tags": [
          "redesign"
        ],
        "detail_text": "Redesign b2b\ndirect mailing solution\nux lead\nui design\nUser testing\nIlLustrations\nEeloy Ag\ncontext & brief/\nRedesign the 8 Years old Direct Mailing solution called Seeds, utilized by our customers Mercedes car dealerships. The update must embrace Material Design principles and significantly simplify navigation for new clients, while ensuring existing users can still operate the system with ease. This redesign aims to enhance user experience without disrupting established workflows.\nBiggest ChallengeS\nSimplifying a complex, evolved system while keeping all data accessible to veteran users. Solution: Introduce an 'Expert Mode' for them and a simplified standard mode for new users. To ease onboarding, we implemented a multi-step process with forms, status checkers, and a traffic-light system to track progress. The effectiveness of these integrations is currently being evaluated.\nsetup\nfilter\nexample\noverview\nSoftware stack\nFIGMA, Adobe CC, Asana, Php, React Js, Nextcloud, Material Design Library 3.0\n",
