        "scope": "Internal Process Management Solution",
        "tags": [
          "prozess"
        ],
        "detail_text": "Internal Business process\nmanagement solution\nBusiness analysis\nux lead\nui design\nProject management\nIT Consulting\nTesting\nWespro gmbh\ncontext & brief/\nSeamlessly integrate stages from planning to delivery in a unified system. Customized the technology to handle offer generation, client agreements, invoicing, graphic design, printing, quality assurance, delivery, setup, and invoice tracking, streamlining workflow and client communication in a unified System.\nChallEnges\n1. Data Privacy: Ensuring all data is securely hosted on the company's private server, meeting stringent privacy requirements.\n\n2. Project Diversity: Managing a wide range of projects, from large-scale constructions to minor print jobs, within a single system.\n3. Limited Resources: Streamlining processes for a small team handling multiple departments - from initial building to final onsite construction including project management.\n4. Time Constraints: Handling tight deadlines, particularly for significant construction projects that often involve last-minute installation in stores.\noverview\nstatus\nprogress\ncalendar\nSoftware stack\nFigma, Nextcloud, AWS, Php, Vue.JS,Jira Cloud,",
