        "language": "en",
        "year": "2018",
        "client": "Greyt.IT UG",
        "scope": "Peer 2 Peer Marketplace for Advice",
        "tags": [
          "plattform",
          "designsystem"
        ],
        "detail_text": "Website &\ndesign system\nart director\nux lead\nui design\nProject management\nMarketing\nContent creation\nBugfixing\n\nGetme\ncontext & brief/\nCreate a marketplace platform with a dual focus: connecting users with skilled individuals who match their specific needs and facilitating trust through a unique reputation system. It offers two key features: a feedback mechanism where users can pay for valuable insights, and a direct query tool for tailored questionnaires. This platform emphasizes ease of finding and trusting unknown skilled professionals.\nBiggest challenges\nImplementing a corruption-proof, one-click payment system, resolved via an innovative invoicing method. Encouraging content uploads for feedback was a hurdle, tackled by incentivizing users with potential rewards and collaboration opportunities. The platform integrates comprehensive functionalities, including video calling, invoicing, a feedback tool, and an advanced CRM system, to enhance user interaction and management.\nupload\nfeedback\nprojects\ndialouges\nSoftware Stack uSED\nFigma, Adobe CC, AWS EC2, Lambda, Elastic Encoder, Stripe Connect, Angular JS, Type Script, Ruby on Rails, Next JS, Solana, Jitsi, Etherium, Jira Cloud",
